      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, a continuous first-person POV walk at adult eye height begins with the view in <Picture 1>. The camera moves forward along the visible path at a relaxed, steady walking pace. After a few steps, the camera pans right at slow speed while continuing forward, bringing the right-hand scenery into the center and shifting the path toward the left of the frame. As the walk continues, the camera pans slowly left across the forward view, bringing the left-hand scenery into the center. The view then settles on the next stretch of the path as the camera continues forward. The view contains only the surroundings shown in <Picture 1>, and the path ahead stays clear. Nearby landmarks pass the frame edges with natural parallax, while the horizon stays level.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft, regular footsteps continue over a quiet outdoor ambience.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
