      "widgets_values": [
        "{\n \"右を見てから前へ（標準）\": \"After a few steps, the camera pans right at slow speed while continuing forward, bringing the right-hand scenery into the center and shifting the path toward the left of the frame. As the walk continues, the camera pans slowly left across the forward view, bringing the left-hand scenery into the center. The view then settles on the next stretch of the path as the camera continues forward.\",\n \"左を見てから前へ\": \"After a few steps, the camera pans left at slow speed while continuing forward, bringing the left-hand scenery into the center and shifting the path toward the right of the frame. The camera then pans slowly back to the right until the path is centered again, and the view settles on the next stretch of the path as the camera continues forward.\",\n \"前だけを見て歩く\": \"The camera keeps facing straight ahead along the path for the whole walk, without panning left or right, and the path stays centered in the frame as the camera continues forward.\"\n}",
